     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">Dear Professor,</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">I am trying to save the genetic map with genotype information in csv file using the following codes-</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">  mycross &lt;- replace.map(mycross, mymap)</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">  mymapAsTable &lt;- pull.map(mymap, as.table=TRUE)</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">  write.csv(mymapAsTable, file=&quot;mymap.csv&quot;)</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">But from this I am getting the csv file only with marker positions (please see attached file). But for QTL mapping I need the genotype information of each marker in this map as well. Is there any code by which I can  do so?</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">Many thanks in advance.</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">Best regards,</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\">Mehedi</span><br><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">Use write.cross:</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">  write.cross(mycross, &quot;csv&quot;, &quot;mycross&quot;)</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">Would it be okay for me to post your question and my response to the R/qtl discussion group? (</span><a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/Rqtl-disc\" style=\"color:rgb(54,82,93);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/Rqtl-disc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448367213000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2akwCYKrHQ6b-uY4DjFMN1\">http://groups.google.com/group/Rqtl-disc</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">)</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">I prefer to have R/qtl correspondence through there, so that others may benefit.</span><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><br style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px\">karl</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,0,102);font-family:Menlo,Consolas,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:11.8181819915771px;line-height:15.600001335144px;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><br></span></div></div>"
